/* 设计稿里没有这一页：头部沿用活动详情的返回按钮和页面标题样式（30/40/900），正文用正文字号（14/22） */
.doc-header { position: relative; height: calc(254rpx + var(--sx-safe-top)); color: #FFFFFF; }
.doc-back {
  position: absolute; left: 23rpx; top: calc(15rpx + var(--sx-safe-top));
  display: flex; align-items: center; height: 85rpx; padding: 0 15rpx;
}
.doc-back__icon { display: block; width: 38rpx; height: 38rpx; }
.doc-header__title { position: absolute; left: 38rpx; bottom: 46rpx; font-size: 58rpx; line-height: 77rpx; font-weight: 900; }

.doc-body { padding: 46rpx 38rpx calc(77rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
.doc-meta { margin-bottom: 31rpx; font-size: 23rpx; line-height: 35rpx; color: #5E6170; }
.doc-section { margin-top: 54rpx; }
.doc-h { margin-bottom: 15rpx; font-size: 31rpx; line-height: 46rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #010439; }
.doc-p { margin-top: 15rpx; font-size: 27rpx; line-height: 42rpx; color: #14141E; }
